atics. He provides empirical background on networks and the regularities that they exhibit, and discusses random graph-based models and strategic models of network formation. He helps readers to understand behavior in networked societies, with a detailed analysis of learning and diffusion in networks, decision making by individuals who are influenced by their social neighbors, game theory and markets on networks, and a host of related subjects. Jackson also describes the varied statistical and modeling techniques used to analyze social networks. Each chapter includes exercises to aid students in their analysis of how networks function.","publicationYear":2008,"subjectCategories":[{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Social networks","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-social-and-economic-networks-matthew-o-jackson"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Communication","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-social-and-economic-networks-matthew-o-jackson"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Business networks","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-social-and-economic-networks-matthew-o-jackson"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Netzwerk","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-social-and-economic-networks-matthew-o-jackson"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Wirtschaft","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-social-and-economic-networks-matthew-o-jackson"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Netzwerkanalyse (soziologie)","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-social-and-economic-networks-matthew-o-jackson"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Soziales netzwerk","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-social-and-economic-networks-matthew-o-jackson"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Hm741 .j33 2008","sourceId":"source-op